OL,3,CDozens of firefighters tackle field
OL,4,Cblaze near Hampshire observatory
OL,6,FAround 50 firefighters are tackling a
OL,7,Fblaze in a large field near Chilbolton.
OL,9,FThe alarm was raised off Drove Road
OL,10,Fjust after 4.30 pm on Sunday, August
OL,11,F2nd.
OL,13,FIt's a short distance from a number of
OL,14,Fhomes and the Chilbolton Observatory.
OL,16,FSmoke can be seen from the M3 and
OL,17,FWinchester.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/2
