OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785759509
OL,3,CDozens of firefighters tackle field
OL,4,Cblaze near Hampshire observatory
OL,6,FCrews from Basingstoke, Alton,
OL,7,FAndover, Beaulieu, Whitchurch,
OL,8,FOverton, Alresford, Rushmoor, Sutton
OL,9,FScotney and Stockbridge, alongside an
OL,10,FIncident Command Unit and colleagues
OL,11,Ffrom Dorset and Wiltshire Fire and
OL,12,FRescue Service, are in attendance.
OL,14,FThey've asked the public to stay away
OL,15,Ffrom the area because of the number of
OL,16,Femergency vehicles.
OL,18,FLocal people are being urged to keep
OL,19,Fdoors and windows closed.
